{"id":"H6081","lemma":"עֵ֫פֶר","transliteration":"epher","sayIt":"e-pher","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Epher","meaning":"A man of the Midianites living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.25.4;\nson of: Midian (H4080);\nbrother of: Ephah (H5891), Hanoch (H2585I), Abida (H0028) and Eldaah (H0420)\n§ Epher = \"a calf\"\n1) the 2nd son of Midian\n2) a son of Ezra, among the descendants of Judah\n3) one of the heads of the families of Manasseh on the east of the Jordan","glosses":["epher"],"count":4,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-25","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"Epher","kjv":"and Epher"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":33,"renderings":{"bsb":"Epher","kjv":"and Epher"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-4","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"Epher","kjv":"and Epher"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-5","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"Epher","kjv":"even Epher"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 25:4","note":"The sons of Midian were Ephah, Epher, Hanoch, Abida, and Eldaah. All these were the children of Keturah.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 1:33","note":"The sons of Midian: Ephah, Epher, Hanoch, Abida, and Eldaah. All these were the sons of Keturah.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0028","lemma":"אֲבִידָע","transliteration":"avida","gloss":"Abida"},{"id":"H0420","lemma":"אֶלְדָּעָה","transliteration":"eldaah","gloss":"Eldaah"},{"id":"H2585","lemma":"חֲנוֹךְ","transliteration":"chanokh","gloss":"Enoch"},{"id":"H3210","lemma":"יָלוֹן","transliteration":"yalon","gloss":"Jalon"},{"id":"H3500","lemma":"יֶ֫תֶר","transliteration":"yeter","gloss":"Jether"},{"id":"H4080","lemma":"מִדְיָן","transliteration":"midyan","gloss":"Midian"},{"id":"H4778","lemma":"מֶ֫רֶד","transliteration":"mered","gloss":"Mered"},{"id":"H5834","lemma":"עֶזְרָה","transliteration":"ezrah","gloss":"Ezrah"}],"senses":[{"id":"H6081H","gloss":"Epher","relation":"H6081H ="},{"id":"H6081I","gloss":"Epher","relation":"H6081I ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged tex